  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Program for Civil Society in the Western Balkans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program, called SMART Balkans, contributes to strengthening participatory democracies and Euro Atlantic integrations in the Western Balkans by empowering civil society organizations and CSO networks for stronger and active role in creating peaceful and inclusive societies for sustainable development in Albania, Bosnia and Herzegovina, Kosovo, Montenegro, North Macedonia, and Serbia.</narrative>
  </description>
